  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-116\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 116</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Le présent décret entre en vigueur le 1er janvier 2024, à l'exception des dispositions dont la date d'entrée en vigueur est fixée aux alinéas 2 à 4.</p>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Les dispositions suivantes entrent en vigueur le 13 septembre 2024:</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 31, 3°</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 35, 3°</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 39, 2°</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 40, 2° et 3°</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 41, 1° et 3°</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 108, 2°</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Les articles suivants entrent en vigueur le 13 octobre 2024, aux fins du renouvellement intégral des organes d'administration en décembre 2024 après les élections organisées le 13 octobre 2024:</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 89</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 90</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 92</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 93</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 94</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 95</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 96</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"8°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 97</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"9°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 98</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"10°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 99</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"11°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 100</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"12°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 105</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"13°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 111</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"14°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 113</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"15°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 114</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"16°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 115</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Les articles suivants entrent en vigueur le 1er décembre 2024, aux fins de la réunion d'installation en décembre 2024:</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 91</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 101</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 102</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 103</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 104</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 106</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">l'article 110</span></li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
